---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero__grid">
    <div class="hero__text">
      <p class="eyebrow">Podcast editor · Producer · Educator</p>
      <h1>Podcasts that sound as good as the stories behind them.</h1>
      <p class="hero__lead">I edit and mix podcasts for creators and organizations, and I teach workshops that help new podcasters plan, record, and edit with confidence.</p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://calendly.com/yaminiranjan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a consultation</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/workshops/">Explore workshops</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__media">
      <img src="/assets/img/hero-yamini.png" alt="Yamini Ranjan wearing studio headphones" width="1024" height="1536">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="proof" aria-label="Featured in">
  <div class="wrap proof__inner">
    <p class="proof__label">Featured &amp; heard on</p>
    <ul class="proof__list">
      <li>The Wayland Post</li>
      <li>Peace Talks Radio</li>
      <li>Apple Podcasts</li>
      <li>Wayland Free Public Library</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How I can help</p>
      <h2>Two ways to work together</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="pillars">
      <article class="pillar">
        <img src="/assets/img/service-editing.jpg" alt="Audio waveforms in an editing timeline" loading="lazy">
        <div class="pillar__body">
          <h3>Podcast editing &amp; mixing</h3>
          <p>Hand your raw recordings to an editor who listens for the story. I shape each episode, clean up the audio, and mix it into something listeners want to finish.</p>
          <ul class="checks">
            <li>Story editing, framing, and pacing</li>
            <li>Noise reduction and audio cleanup</li>
            <li>Music, sound design, and final mix</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="link" href="/services/">See editing services</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar">
        <img src="/assets/img/service-speaking.gif" alt="Yamini speaking at a podium" loading="lazy">
        <div class="pillar__body">
          <h3>Workshops &amp; classes</h3>
          <p>Hands-on sessions for schools, libraries, community groups, and new creators who want to learn how podcasts are planned, recorded, and edited.</p>
          <ul class="checks">
            <li>Podcasting from idea to first episode</li>
            <li>Audio editing fundamentals</li>
            <li>Storytelling and interviewing for audio</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="link" href="/workshops/">See workshops</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">The process</p>
      <h2>From raw audio to a finished episode</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <h3>Consultation</h3>
        <p>We talk through your show, your audience, and what you need — a single episode, a full season, or ongoing support.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Edit &amp; mix</h3>
        <p>I edit for story and clarity, clean up the audio, and add music and sound design using professional tools like Hindenburg Pro.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Review &amp; deliver</h3>
        <p>You listen, share feedback, and receive a polished episode that’s ready to publish.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap feature">
    <div class="feature__media">
      <img src="/assets/img/featured-wow.jpg" alt="Yamini with a Women of Wayland Season 3 sign" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="feature__text">
      <p class="eyebrow">Featured work</p>
      <h2>Women of Wayland</h2>
      <p class="lead">A hometown podcast celebrating the remarkable women next door — now in its fifth season.</p>
      <p>I created, host, and produce the show: from finding guests and recording interviews to editing, sound design, and publishing.</p>
      <div class="feature__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/portfolio/">View portfolio</a>
        <a class="link" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/women-of-wayland-the-podcast/id1471535994" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Listen on Apple Podcasts</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head section__head--split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Testimonials</p>
        <h2>What clients say</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="link" href="/testimonials/">Read all testimonials</a>
    </div>
    <div class="quotes">
      {%- for t in testimonials %}{% if t.featured %}
      <figure class="quote">
        <blockquote>“{{ t.excerpt }}”</blockquote>
        <figcaption><strong>{{ t.name }}</strong><span>{{ t.role }}</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "cta.njk" %}
